# permitted ids (device test 2026-11-19: dev.nxpocket.gameapp.usb.build.1 refused against dev.nxpocket.gameapp.* and accepted once dev.nxpocket.gameapp.usb.build.* was listed).
#  * Info.plist.fragment lists the SideStore id of this project's team; the export lists the player's own id and the installer's suffix variant; scripts/usb-install.sh adds the cable install's.
#  * "Prepare the shaders" now runs under that task (progress on the lock screen) and keeps going when the app is left (GameAppWarm.cs, GameAppBackground.cs).
# Applies after 0055.
